<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WATSON PHARMACEUTICALS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WATSON PHARMACEUTICALS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it raised Watson Pharmaceuticals Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- said ups one-year price target to $66 from $56 and set a two-year price target of $80.</p>
<p>-- said raised 1997 earnings estimate to $2.30 a share from $2.25 a share, upped the 1998 estimate to $2.85 from $2.80 a share and incresed the 1999 estimate to $3.50 a share from $3.45 a share.</p>
<p>-- Watson gained 10/16 to 48-3/16.</p>
</text>
